@AvaluoAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000

### Login
POST {{AvaluoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "contrasena"
}

### Obtener resumen de SO (requiere auth)
GET {{AvaluoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/studentOutcomes
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Listar evaluaciones paginadas (requiere auth)
GET {{AvaluoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/evaluaciones?page=1&recordsPerPage=10
Authorization: Bearer <token>
